[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3]

; unit-cpuparticles2d-color-ramp.tscn with both Gradients in a .tres: the one variable is where the ramps are stored.
; Both Gradient slots. `color_ramp` is sampled by age, so one particle changes colour as it travels.
; `color_initial_ramp` is sampled once at birth, so it varies between particles. The two emitters
; differ only in the slot.

